      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZIPPING BAFF (1) was a winner two back when racing on speed but drifted back latest and safely held when 7th and beaten 4.5 lengths at this track (25.48). Got the money at her only try from this box. Has ability and looks hard to stop. DUST CARGO (5) finished in the money two on end before breaking through for an overdue win last start (19.87) at this track. Super consistent and can feature with the right run. EARLY CONCRETE (2) produced a moderate performance last time when sixth at this track over 340m behind From The Disco (20.39) in a Grade 5. Was in the money prior to that. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from three starts. Should be about the money. TOMMY THE FROG (7) must be respected despite an unplaced effort here most recently.",
